OL,3,GNEWSAScotland to be hit with 80mph wind
OL,4,Agusts as Storm Boelo warning upgraded
OL,5,Ato amber
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn amber alert has been issued for much
OL,8,Fof Scotland over the weekend, with
OL,9,FStorm Boelo expected to bring strong
OL,10,Fwinds, flying debris and potential
OL,11,Fpower cuts.
OL,13,FIt is the second of two storms due to
OL,14,Fhit Scotland within days, with Storm
OL,15,FAusten's wet and windy conditions
OL,16,Falready causing some disruption to
OL,17,Ftransport.
OL,19,FThe latest Met Office warnings include
OL,20,Fa yellow warning for rain in central
OL,21,Fand eastern areas from 07:00 on Friday
OL,22,Funtil midnight.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
