OL,3,GNEWSAScotland to be hit with 80mph wind
OL,4,Agusts as Storm Boelo warning upgraded
OL,5,Ato amber
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, the wind alert for Storm
OL,8,FBoelo has been upgraded from yellow to
OL,9,Famber for the whole mainland and the
OL,10,FWestern Isles, lasting from 21:00 on
OL,11,FSaturday until 21:00 on Sunday. Orkney
OL,12,Fremains under the yellow alert.
